// Sum of the labeled margins that appear on at least two kept pairs.
// A margin that appears once adds nothing. A repeated margin is added again.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mrsum ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mrsum rank

IMPULSE mrsum 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mrsum" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
